---
description: When converting HEP analysis ↔ ADL or editing .adl files, use HepToAdlDraft and the hep-to-adl skills.
globs:
  - "**/*.adl"
alwaysApply: false
---

When converting HEP analysis code or notes to ADL, or when editing `.adl`
in this repo, read the **hep-to-adl** skill first. Fill `HepToAdlDraft`
before emitting cuts. Do not invent pT, eta, isolation, ID, trigger, or
overlap selections. Missing cuts stay `# TODO:` or `*.unresolved.md`.
Delegate inventory to **hep-code-read** and writing to **adl-authoring**.
Do not touch smash2 / `reimplementation/` / `legacy_parser/` sources.
